        <mxCell id="runtime-theming-box" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;arcSize=8;" value="Runtime Theming (How It Works):&#xa;&#xa;1. User authenticates → Org ID detected&#xa;   (from URL param, token claim, or path)&#xa;&#xa;2. Fetch org theme configuration&#xa;   GET /api/v1/orgs/{orgId}/theme&#xa;   Returns: colors, logo URLs, branding&#xa;&#xa;3. Apply theme to DOM&#xa;   • Set CSS variables (--primary-color, etc.)&#xa;   • Load logo from CDN&#xa;   • Update favicon, page title&#xa;   • Cache in localStorage&#xa;&#xa;4. Theme persists across navigation&#xa;   • All features see same theme&#xa;   • No rebuild needed for changes&#xa;   • Instant switching between orgs&#xa;&#xa;Benefits:&#xa;✓ 14+ orgs share same build&#xa;✓ Instant branding updates&#xa;✓ New org onboarding: &lt;1 hour&#xa;✓ Single deployment for all" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="460" width="400" x="1680" y="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="differences-box" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3e0;strokeColor=#ff9800;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;arcSize=8;" value="Key Differences vs. Module Federation:&#xa;&#xa;❌ NO Module Federation&#xa;   • No remotes&#xa;   • No component registry&#xa;   • No remote health checks&#xa;   • No federation config&#xa;&#xa;✅ Single Unified App&#xa;   • All code in one repo&#xa;   • Standard React + Webpack&#xa;   • Direct imports (not dynamic)&#xa;   • Simpler build&#xa;&#xa;✅ Runtime Theming Instead of Entity MFEs&#xa;   • Themes = JSON config (not apps)&#xa;   • CSS variables (not separate bundles)&#xa;   • CDN assets (not deployed MFEs)&#xa;&#xa;✅ Simplified Everything&#xa;   • 1 build (not 3+)&#xa;   • 1 pipeline (not multiple)&#xa;   • 1 deployment (not per-entity)&#xa;   • 15 min builds (not 2-3 hours)&#xa;&#xa;Complexity Reduction: 70%&#xa;Timeline Reduction: 50% (6 wks vs 12 wks)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="480" width="400" x="1680" y="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
